      "prompt": "UNZIT does not treat patients while they are taking isotretinoin. Combining it with other acne medicines, especially antibiotic pills, can be unsafe, and your prescribing doctor needs to be the only one directing your acne care. You can stop here and come back after your course ends, at no charge. Or you can finish this visit and Dr. Om will personally decide whether UNZIT can help you, before any plan or prescription is made.",
